    "Details": "The only almost fully indirect weapons loadout of the Polyphemus, the C configuration mounts an Enhanced LRM-20 launcher in each arm and a Thunderbolt 20 launcher in the left side torso. Two Medium Pulse Lasers were added in case extra firepower is needed, and the AMS Mk2 common for all of the loadouts remains.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.35</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
